5,"the"],[15.225,0.338,"pains"],[15.575,0.125,"of"],[15.713,0.412,"birth"],[16.15,0.25,"old"],[16.413,0.375,"age"],[16.8,0.163,"and"],[16.975,0.438,"death"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"Marks of one who is free","visual":["Does not hate the gunas, nor long for them","Sits like a witness, unmoved","A clod, a stone and gold are alike"],"L":["L4"],"say":"Arjuna asks the natural question: what does such a person look like? Krishna answers. They do not hate light, activity or delusion when they come, and do not long for them when they go. They sit like a witness, knowing it is only the modes at work. To them, a clod of earth, a stone and gold are alike; praise and blame are the same.","start":130.632,"at":131.208,"end":154.656,"words":[[0.075,0.438,"Arjuna"],[0.525,0.438,"asks"],[0.975,0.087,"the"],[1.075,0.4,"natural"],[1.488,0.487,"question"],[2.688,0.125,"what"],[2.825,0.125,"does"],[2.962,0.212,"such"],[3.188,0.062,"a"],[3.263,0.425,"person"],[3.7,0.2,"look"],[3.913,0.35,"like"],[4.65,0.388,"Krishna"],[5.05,0.637,"answers"],[6.062,0.087,"They"],[6.162,0.113,"do"],[6.287,0.188,"not"],[6.487,0.263,"hate"],[6.763,0.362,"light"],[7.6,0.613,"activity"],[8.225,0.15,"or"],[8.387,0.562,"delusion"],[8.963,0.125,"when"],[9.1,0.125,"they"],[9.238,0.388,"come"],[10.137,0.113,"and"],[10.262,0.1,"do"],[10.375,0.225,"not"],[10.613,0.287,"long"],[10.912,0.15,"for"],[11.075,0.212,"them"],[11.3,0.125,"when"],[11.438,0.113,"they"],[11.562,0.338,"go"],[12.275,0.1,"They"],[12.387,0.3,"sit"],[12.7,0.188,"like"],[12.9,0.087,"a"],[13.0,0.537,"witness"],[13.562,0.4,"knowing"],[13.975,0.15,"it"],[14.137,0.163,"is"],[14.312,0.3,"only"],[14.625,0.087,"the"],[14.725,0.375,"modes"],[15.113,0.125,"at"],[15.25,0.5,"work"],[16.15,0.1,"To"],[16.262,0.35,"them"],[16.887,0.075,"a"],[16.975,0.325,"clod"],[17.312,0.1,"of"],[17.425,0.388,"earth"],[18.238,0.075,"a"],[18.325,0.45,"stone"],[18.788,0.113,"and"],[18.913,0.388,"gold"],[19.312,0.113,"are"],[19.438,0.487,"alike"],[20.562,0.412,"praise"],[20.98